==============================================================================
W3  Adequacy sweep (thermal nameplate / mean demand)
==============================================================================
Expect the benefit to vanish at both ends: with abundant capacity the
risk-neutral planner already commits enough, and with too little no
day-ahead choice can conjure capacity that does not exist.
