==============================================================================
W4  VOLL sweep -- rebuttal to 'the tail result is a high-VOLL artefact'
==============================================================================
VOLL scales the unserved-energy term, which W0 shows is identical under
every policy. If the gap in $/MWh is roughly flat in VOLL, the result
does not come from VOLL. Note the load's deviation price is tied to
VOLL by load_delta_frac, so a mild slope is expected.
